  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2105.04 Appeal from Hearing Decision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2105.04 Appeal from Hearing Decision. Pursuant to RSA 159:6-c, an appeal of a hearing examiner’s decision shall be made to the Concord District Court within 30 days of the decision.\n\nSource. #10380, eff 7-17-13; ss by #13881, eff 2-20-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2100.html"
